    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0705043b73f180069aae8bfe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "居然不去绝对激烈的『菊花赏』，\n反而把首次远征献给了『秋华赏』……。\n连我自己都感到意外啊。不过――",
      "source_fingerprint": "27f7739da3281316d65e9ce081401466e147e58f0e84d316992f792c1cfc907d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112205.json",
