      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年的经典三冠路线中，有一位赛马娘\n格外引人注目。她带来的冲击之强，\n吸引了整个赛马界的目光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f917ea06f344b246510f217253038a1acd9f9676fba5b064d4a3ece0ba75afd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
