      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是啊，勇敢之心正处在最佳状态。\n最巅峰、best 的状态，这点毋庸置疑。\n可是……也存在着无可撼动的事实。",
      "source_fingerprint": "936fa630ab6028ebb9decdda8d269ec31b103682dc3c72ed7862af5b00fd0c4c",
